// output: ["YHOO"]
```

`like` can be used with SQL SELECT to filter columns of STRING type:

```
t = table(`abb`aac`aaa as sym, 1.8 2.3 3.7 as price);
select * from t where sym like "%aa%";
```

| sym | price |
| --- | ----- |
| aac | 2.3   |
| aaa | 3.7   |

